+    d. **Early Termination:** If $T_{cum} < \epsilon_T$, break the loop for this ray.
+4.  **Finalization:**
+    a. Update $i\_end[r]$ to the last processed index.
+    b. Store final transmittance: $alphainv\_last[r] = T_{cum}$.
 
